<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V AUSTRALIA SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V AUSTRALIA SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH, South Africa 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard</p>
<p>on the fourth day of the second test between South Africa and</p>
<p>Australia in Port Elizabeth on Monday:</p>
<p>South Africa first innings 209 (B.McMillan 55; J.Gillespie</p>
<p>5-54)</p>
<p>Australia first innings 108 </p>
<p>South Africa second innings 168</p>
<p>Australia second innings (overnight 145-3)</p>
<p> M.Taylor lbw b McMillan			13</p>
<p> M.Hayden run out				 14</p>
<p> M.Elliott c and b Adams			44</p>
<p> M.Waugh b Kallis				116</p>
<p> S.Waugh c Cronje b Kallis		    18</p>
<p> G.Blewett b Adams				 7</p>
<p> M.Bevan c Cullinan b Cronje		  24</p>
<p> I.Healy not out				  10</p>
<p> S.Warne lbw b Kallis			    3</p>
<p> J.Gillespie not out			     0</p>
<p> Extras (b-11 lb-8 w-3)			 22</p>
<p> Total (for eight wickets)		   271</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-23 2-30 3-113 4-167 5-192 6-258 7-258</p>
<p>8-265</p>
<p>Bowling: Donald 26-6-75-0 (1w), McMillan 21-5-46-1, Cronje</p>
<p>9.3-1-36-1 (1w), Kallis 16-7-29-3, Adams 21-4-66-2 (1w)</p>
<p>Result: Australia won by two wickets to take a winning 2-0</p>
<p>lead in the three test series.</p>
<p>First test: Johannesburg - Australia won by an innings and</p>
<p>196 runs.</p>
<p>Third test: Pretoria, April 21-25.</p>
</text>
